# Scripts & CLI

- Implement behavior in `maze/cli/<module>.py`; register in `[project.scripts]` in `pyproject.toml`.
- `scripts/*.py` at repo root are thin shims to `maze.cli` — prefer `uv run maze-<name>`.
- Do not add features under `scripts/archive/` (frozen; ruff/black excluded).
- `langfuse_demo` is a demo — archive under `scripts/demos/` in D3, not production paths.
- See `scripts/README.md` for maintained / promoted / archive table.
